+2. Retrieve the elastic user's password.
+  $ kubectl get secrets --namespace={{ .Release.Namespace }} {{ .Values.elasticsearchCredentialSecret }} -ojsonpath='{.data.password}' | base64 -d
+3. Retrieve the kibana service account token.
